"""Rainbow HAT 3-bit binary counter with touchpad-driven toggling.

Touchpads A (GPIO5), B (GPIO6), and C (GPIO12) toggle bits 4, 2, and 1
respectively.  The 14-segment display shows the decimal value 0-7,
the discrete LEDs reflect the three bit states, the APA102 strip
lights a single pixel at index equal to the value (red=touch A, green=touch B,
blue=touch C) or dim white at index 0 or all white at index 7, and a 0.5 s
tone + onboard LEDs fire on each press.
"""

